{"id":"f087ee6129f8ad65","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Integrable Simple Function","display":"df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function — ZFC Measure10 Integrable Simple Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function — ZFC Measure10 Integrable Simple Function","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure5-simple-function]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function — ZFC Measure10 Integrable Simple Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf669143a6c6007e\" href=\"?note=cf669143a6c6007e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure5-simple-function\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure5-simple-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\mu,\\Sigma,X\\in V\">\\(s,\\mu,\\Sigma,X\\in V\\)</span> (simple function and measure-space parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S\\)</span> (canonical predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10IntegrableSimpleFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10IntegrableSimpleFunction}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10IntegrableSimpleFunction}_S(s,\\mu,\\Sigma,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,s)\\land\\int_X|s|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10IntegrableSimpleFunction}_S(s,\\mu,\\Sigma,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,s)\\land\\int_X|s|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Simplicity and measurability are delegated to the canonical predicate; absolute integrability avoids the undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\cdot\\infty\">\\(0\\cdot\\infty\\)</span> cases of a noncanonical finite representation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure5-simple-function","status":"resolved","id":"cf669143a6c6007e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure5-simple-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,\\mu,\\Sigma,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10IntegrableSimpleFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10IntegrableSimpleFunction}_S(s,\\mu,\\Sigma,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,s)\\land\\int_X|s|\\,d\\mu<\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"0\\cdot\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":1277,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2543","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function.md|58-df-zfc-measure10-integrable-simple-function]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["cf669143a6c6007e","83a15c7e9b3817dc","4884f45058a56aac"]}